=== 2. what the encoders did during the idle ==========================
  over 210.00 s of idle, at 500 Hz of joint state:
                                              drive      steer
  distinct counts visited                       145         28
  count CHANGES (each re-arms the window)        144         53
  count excursion, max - min                    859         27
  count NET change, last - first                859         -2

  DITHER OR CREEP: a net change equal to the excursion is the
  wheel slowly turning; an excursion with a net change of zero
  and many changes is one count boundary being crossed and
  re-crossed. The sub-count residual says which boundary:
  drive angle in counts, residual from the nearest grid point
